<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
    Every word the game shows, the menu's and the run's, in English. values-de and values-pl hold the
    same keys in German and Polish, and GameTextTest holds each of them to this file.
    Placeholders are %1$d and %1$s, numbered; nothing else is read as one, so a bare % is just a
    percent sign.
-->
